                "text": "It was great to visit the new Lakeshore Regional Child Advocacy Center in Sheboygan. They provide vital support to vulnerable children across Wisconsin\u2019s 6th District.\n\nLast year alone, they conducted 108 medical exams, 514 forensic interviews, and made 535 advocacy connections. I\u2019m grateful for their essential work!",
